 net, opposite faces are …", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "not touching", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "next to each other", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m5u06s1r08", "type": "num", "prompt": "Squares in a net of an open-top cube box?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 5, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}], "prac": [{"id": "m5u06s1p01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "4 in a row with 1 above the 1st and 1 below the 4th:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "a net (Z-like)", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "not a net", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m5u06s1p02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "3 in a row with 3 above them:", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "not a net", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "a net", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m5u06s1p03", "type": "num", "prompt": "Area of a cube net with 2 cm edges (cm²)?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 24, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "6 × 4.", "reason": ""}, {"id": "m5u06s1p04", "type": "explain", "prompt": "Explain how to check whether a shape of 6 squares is a net of a cube.", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "rubric": [{"pt": "imagine folding", "kw": ["fold"]}, {"pt": "no overlaps / every face once", "kw": ["overlap|lid|once|gap"]}], "need": 2, "model": "Imagine folding it round a base: if each square makes a different face with no overlaps or gaps, it is a net.", "hint": "", "reason": "Imagine folding it round a base: if each square makes a different face with no overlaps or gaps, it is a net."}, {"id": "m5u06s1p05", "type": "num", "prompt": "Number of edges glued (joined) when folding a cube net?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 7, "unit": "×", 